Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my struggles\Nshoot me through the sky It'd be a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,if we lingered here And let our pretty\Nsparks of life blend aloud and disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even you can't\Nnavigate If someone strong like you is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,then who will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves cast my heart\Nadrift, it's been your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.04,0:00:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and your strength That would free\Nme from the mist And just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail to a new dawn Weigh\Nanchor right as high as you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,can I assure I don't need\Nanger I go fast as I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I hear you laughing like you're numb\Nto it all But we're dashing together No,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.18,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we're never gonna fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the whole world may\Nnow be my enemy. Water's slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but I ain't backing down so long as\NI'm free, yeah Thought I'd give income,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,ride the current with me All in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,wake up bright and early,\Nmaking for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.58,0:01:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is the best\Nday ever! Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I found some shaved ice right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.63,0:01:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, oh boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had shaved ice\Nbefore, that sounds so neat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go, Nami! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:01:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it melts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got a ton of flavors!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how do I pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.30,0:02:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I want red bean soup flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.26,0:02:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.42,0:02:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you told me to go,\Nbut I can't leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You must!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.58,0:02:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you let me help you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This matter is ours to settle, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop wasting my time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bring me Straw Hat, little baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Curts of a ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end this Sneak Pole Skulling Jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn to ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You baby scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire, great forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an Admiral of the Navy,\Nyou arrogant little dope!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:04:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I could rise to that position\Nwith such an obvious weakness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Water gives life to humans and the\Nrest of the natural world as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.70,0:04:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Rhyzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a new plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His branches keep growing back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.74,0:04:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Think, Cat, he must have some weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we cut all of his\Nbranches at once somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruh-hahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wominosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruh-hahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.48,0:05:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hidden stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.09,0:05:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems we've been sniffed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You were with the rest of the crew,\Nso naturally I got suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like I'm some kind of hyena.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit moldy down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to hide this route from\NOrochi and Kaido, to no avail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, their lead\Nperformer, Jack, is a fishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.14,0:05:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So despite my best efforts, they\Nfound the polyglyph in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What does being a fishman\Nhave to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a lot of stares.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How far down are you going to take us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How far?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.81,0:05:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A few hundred years or so, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tang, where was that light coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.56,0:06:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a glass window\Nthat lets you look outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take a quick peek, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.76,0:06:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already at the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.56,0:06:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole city underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the land of Wano from\Nabout 800 years in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.30,0:06:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The original, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.82,0:06:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:07:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.94,0:07:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A fine question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand the how and the\Nwhen, but the why is lost to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason it's so well preserved is\Nbecause that's not actually seawater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I do know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Wano was once located at a\Nbase of a huge mountain called Fujiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,At one point, walls were created,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,enclosing the island, causing\Nrainfall to accumulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As time passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.90,0:07:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the town became Unbelievable,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so the people moved up\Nthe mountain and built
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,a new country far above\Nwhat you're seeing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.98,0:07:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the modern-day land of Juana?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A road poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the third one that\Nwe've found on our journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can make our way to Laugh Tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a small cave at the foot of\NFujiyama, where the water doesn't reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,this isn't the only thing buried down here\Nit is said the ancient weapon pluton lies
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.64,0:08:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,further beneath us i've\Nnever seen the weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,myself and i'm afraid\Ni can't show it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,now in order to retrieve\Nit the giant walls
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,must first be removed\Nopening the borders of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,wano not only lowers our\Ndefenses but unleashes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the power of an ancient\Nweapon on the world
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How frightful that is.\NQuite the risk, but that was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,odin's wish why would he want\Nthat for this country well
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,i've told you everything\Nthat was passed down to me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,i haven't a clue what Odin\Nlearned to cross the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,so his intentions remain a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Strupee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bepo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The shaved ice here is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Where? I need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I need it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.22,0:09:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave our country alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Bobonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:09:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for Mother Nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,in case you haven't caught on yet, the\Nreason I'm here is because Kaido is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.32,0:10:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a deterrent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he ran this\Ncountry into the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But lucky for you, we're not\Nplanning to invade right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you want me to go away,\Nthen bring me Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the Straw Hats now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.28,0:10:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine, they won't lose to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same reason why\NI cannot ask you for aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You've spent your entire life\Nimprisoned on Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but now you can finally be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So I will send you off properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been depending on Luffy and his\Nfriends to see me through these trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But we who remain in this country\Nmust be able to stand on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot rely on those who are departing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our country to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We must drive out its\Nenemies with our own power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must you fail me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, you're a pretty\Npathetic excuse for a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had just about enough\Nof your stupid games.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It finally worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:11:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of our lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:12:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He already wields that\Nattack like Kaido himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I said go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave one, or have never come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He has the full power of a dragon now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, but his aim still\Nleaves much to be desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to burn\Ndown the whole city?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think I'm scared\Nof some kind of wannabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Try that again and I'll\Nskewer you from head to tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I move?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Conqueror's Haki...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The red-haired pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.96,0:13:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just bust your\NHaki out without a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.92,0:13:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The new recruits can't handle it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying you have\Nto be nice, Mr. Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But these pirates fought\Nhard to change history.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you'd be in poor sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stomping out flowers before\Nyou know what color they bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this new era frighten you so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.62,0:14:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm not trying to\Nfight you guys At least not yet
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, alright, I get it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.70,0:14:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You've defended the land of Wano just\Nlike you said. I can protect this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can protect my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You did pretty good, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume the rest of you felt\Nthat overwhelming Haki. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.26,0:14:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that sure was crazy, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Made me think of an old friend for a sec
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu, Raizo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.06,0:15:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,they just need fluids and some rest\Nthey'll be better soon i promise
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,that is a relief he was right i hate to\Nagree with him but the whole world feared
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,gaito as long as he held wano in his iron
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,grip no one would dare\Nset foot on his shores
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,forgive me to my great\Nshame i was in cootie
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,at the time and wholly\Nignorant of your struggle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It all worked out fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody blames you, Gaara.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke really put in the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, how was Tsuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's hurt, but she will live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She was burned when Okobore Town set fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed to protect her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Tsuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard King came back to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.27,0:16:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He had to hurry back to\Nthe flower capital, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're from the capital, too, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be with you, my love. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.86,0:16:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited long enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, even after 20 years, she's as\Nbeautiful as she was on her wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough mushy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're becoming even\Nmore of a dog than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.74,0:16:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Rizal, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.98,0:16:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hounding after the ladies even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.78,0:17:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.24,0:17:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Dogstorm and Master\NCatviper have some big news!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They need you to come right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, finally showed up,\Nhuh? Hey, guys! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some news for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everybody here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta keep us waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.90,0:18:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot, we would like you, Kara,\Nto rule the Mokumo dukedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Works for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't thank me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be awful, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.74,0:18:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The cat and I decided to stay in Wano.\NWe're still Samurai of the Kozuki clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so it is our duty to keep\NLord Momonosuke safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.48,0:18:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugarra have traveled with Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so Yugarra have a broader view\Nof the world than other Minx.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.60,0:18:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the next\Ngeneration will need the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe in Yugarra.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, like me, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's tons of Minx stronger than I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you ask them first?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.20,0:18:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they should not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the duty of the strong to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:19:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,our country i support their decision and i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,will support you tia
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,too
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,carrot
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you tia
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do this. Pedro's\Nwill lives in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He just will. We're counting on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot Tomorrow belongs to the\Nyoung And so should Zo, I say
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden was my son
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.80,0:19:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're alive and well
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.44,0:19:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been so ashamed that\NI almost didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save Odin, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's worse, I couldn't save the\Nland of Wano, despite being Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.12,0:20:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.14,0:20:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have always wanted to\Nmeet you. Me as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You look just like Odin did\Nat your age, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shocked as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But more than anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.56,0:20:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to have a\Nfamily. You cannot know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,what that means to us\Nafter our parents' loss
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So please don't apologize No matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,happened We're so glad\Nto have you with us today
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.72,0:20:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart leapt into my throat
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that he was among us I\Nnever dared to dream such a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Tsukiyaki is alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His disguise was truly flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.72,0:20:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd figured out my\Nsecret, but what was I to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You did wear a Tang mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.58,0:21:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that draws attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We certainly didn't think that\Nyou were an average swordsmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We feigned ignorance out of\Nrespect, but we weren't fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Master Keen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.14,0:21:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.06,0:21:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.46,0:21:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I put you through so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.24,0:21:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you about the\Nland of Wano's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.16,0:21:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I stayed alive all these\Nyears so I could do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.18,0:21:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's all I'm good for anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.50,0:21:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So I beg you, let me seat the throne\Nand let the nation think I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It is yours to create.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.48,0:21:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that you are alive is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That gives us strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you're telling me pluton is buried\Ndown there yes i didn't get to see it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.36,0:21:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,in person mind you but it is here i\Nhonestly wasn't even sure if it existed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,is that the big ship Franky\Nburned the blueprints
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.12,0:22:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,for correct an ancient weapon\Nwith the name of a God,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.60,0:22:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you want to have it, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.78,0:22:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.00,0:22:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But after Odin traveled the\Nseas, he wanted to unleash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.36,0:22:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.00,0:22:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Danger, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.50,0:22:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose a mature woman like me\Nmight strike you right in the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.02,0:22:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I did waste away a\Nbit after that last battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.96,0:22:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's me, Shinobu. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happened to you, I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.98,0:22:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so lovely, it shocked\Nme right down to my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.32,0:22:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, I suppose bones are all I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.66,0:22:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.92,0:23:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.20,0:23:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu's going to teach\Nme to be a real kunoichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.76,0:23:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get real strong, so next time I see\Nyou, You gotta let me join your crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah, we could use a ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So train hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.00,0:23:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.80,0:23:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a bewitching\NKunoichi in no time, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama, you are so precious!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna miss you most of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.94,0:23:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's a shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pluton is in the land of Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So, first Poseidon, and now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.30,0:23:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a certain someone who's gonna\Nbe very interested in this news.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.28,0:24:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun, I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.60,0:24:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The plans are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Reconstruction can begin shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.82,0:24:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.90,0:24:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've included cost estimates\Nfor each region as well. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.46,0:24:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.66,0:24:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have proposals to repurpose\Nthe weapons factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just waiting for your approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.64,0:24:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, can you give me your opinion on
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.96,0:24:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the reservoir when you\Nhave the time we should
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,speak with all the daimyo as well let's
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.32,0:24:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,schedule a meeting in\Nthe near future of course
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.22,0:24:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,hello shogun
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.46,0:24:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.10,0:24:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to learn a few sword techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.38,0:25:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could teach me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.02,0:25:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Luffy! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.82,0:25:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.52,0:25:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Sanji! Chopperman!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.06,0:25:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin! Franky! Bonkichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.88,0:25:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there, Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.88,0:25:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.18,0:25:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did everyone go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.42,0:25:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.20,0:25:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyori, have you seen Luffy and his crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.98,0:25:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They said their farewells.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.68,0:25:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're leaving the land of Wano now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.82,0:25:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.58,0:25:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Said their farewells?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.46,0:25:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't say a word to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.98,0:25:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Lord Momonosuke, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.70,0:25:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.80,0:25:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this about Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.42,0:26:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I just found out that\Nhe's departing You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.34,0:26:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so cruel I asked all the\Nretainers And the Straw Hat spoke to every
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.90,0:26:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,one of them but me Why would they exclude\Nus When we've known them the longest?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.06,0:26:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we're leaving today you don't\Nget to huh what does that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.02,0:26:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,mean don't make it weird all\Nright we can't all sail off
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.06,0:26:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,at the same time our alliance\Nis over remember we're enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.10,0:26:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,now we're leaving today\Nbecause that's what we decided
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.80,0:26:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,on so did we the hell\Ntrafalgar this is my day pick
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.84,0:26:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,another yeah no thanks you can\Nchange your own damn schedule
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.18,0:26:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not changing mine.\NThis is not a little waste of
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.94,0:26:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,time fine how's this we'll go\Nwith different directions the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.96,0:26:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Log Pose locked on the three\Ndifferent islands one is
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.86,0:27:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,northeast ones east and one\Nsoutheast take your pick the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.20,0:27:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Metal, all right. It's your\Nproblem now heading northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.52,0:27:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,gives you the farthest ahead\Nyou know if you had half a brain
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.02,0:27:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cell between you two, you'd\Nget that it's a little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.22,0:27:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,dumbasses I don't care what you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.58,0:27:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,do because I'm heading off now
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.56,0:27:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,have fun bickering all right\NStraw Hat let's draw for it
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.64,0:27:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,when it goes east loser goes\Nsoutheast I picked This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.14,0:27:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I got east.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.76,0:27:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I messed up the draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.10,0:27:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.58,0:27:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just help us load the sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.82,0:27:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be dangerous wherever we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.22,0:27:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.64,0:27:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an emperor of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.60,0:27:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I lose it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.98,0:27:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.89,0:27:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're pissing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.70,0:28:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, there's one emperor\Neven lamer than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.94,0:28:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.14,0:28:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Genius Jester!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.22,0:28:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocodile and Hawkeye are there too! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.32,0:28:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're making it look\Nlike they work for Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.80,0:28:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.71,0:28:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.94,0:28:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkeye wouldn't work for that clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.66,0:28:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If he really has those two under\Nhis control, then I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.68,0:28:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That alone would make\Nhim emperor material.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.54,0:28:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucky's just a dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.30,0:28:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he pull this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.84,0:28:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell you, but the new company\Nhe's running is called Cross Guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.10,0:28:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and they've started putting bounties\Non the heads of famous marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.28,0:28:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy was always a hunter before,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.58,0:29:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but now anyone in the world can come\Nafter them just like us pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.52,0:29:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems that while we were on\Nour little getaway in Wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.70,0:29:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire world turned on its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.14,0:29:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you know where\Nyou're going, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.78,0:29:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing we're headed in different\Ndirections, because we're enemies from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.44,0:29:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a parting gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.14,0:29:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.82,0:29:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a copy of a road poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.18,0:29:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have the right to this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.96,0:29:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheating would take the fun out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.12,0:29:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So Kaido did have one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.92,0:29:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like the thing we swiped\Nfrom one of Big Mom's generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.66,0:29:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the endgame, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.32,0:29:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get serious about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.84,0:29:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what we gotta do if we\Nwanna fight for the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.38,0:29:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the man with the burn scar, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.48,0:29:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's step one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.48,0:30:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have any leads though.\NHuh? What bird scar would you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.18,0:30:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,hear that you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.20,0:30:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,don't know looks
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.68,0:30:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,like I get a head start huh
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.16,0:30:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Yamato, are you here, Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.18,0:30:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not hiding from me are you Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.96,0:30:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.76,0:30:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.50,0:30:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.20,0:30:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of the roof, it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.66,0:30:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.62,0:30:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.78,0:30:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, this is it. I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.86,0:30:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.77,0:30:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to live like Kozogeoden!
